# Lana keeps workspace-local runtime state here. It can include transcripts,
# resolved configuration, logs, and future credential-store material.
.lana/

# Local environment overrides may carry provider credentials. Keep shareable
# templates versionable so setup remains reproducible.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template

# Default local diagnostic output. Explicit fixtures and source-controlled
# examples should use their own paths/extensions instead.
*.log
